# CR 608.2h: the trigger's "if this creature isn't saddled" is judged from the Bronco's last known information. Bot1
# saddles it, attacks, and kills it with Lightning Bolt with the trigger on the stack: it was saddled when it left,
# so Bot2 loses the 2 (there is no combat damage) and Bot1 loses nothing.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Mox Pearl
Caustic Bronco
Cathar Commando
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Cathar Commando
Swamp x6

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

